WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.480
One hot week.

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.670
How long does it take to pay back?

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.240
A street vendor can't stop to rest.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.080
Stopping means losing the day's sales.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:10.930
Then the heat makes him ill.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:14.200
Days of work are lost, and treatment costs money.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.980
A loan fills the gap.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:19.750
Now, on the next hot day, rest costs even more.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.660
Heat, lost income, debt, no rest.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:28.470
Shade, paid rest and income support could make rest possible, if they reach people in time.

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.590
See what could break the cycle.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.970
Beat the heat dot Asia.
